    "body": "**User Experience:**\r\nIf any application does not support resizing of text (Except for captions and images of text) up to 200 percent without loss of content or functionality, the users with mild visual disabilities who scale the text instead of using the assistive technology would be impacted as zooming will not work as desired.\r\n\r\n**Test Environment:**\r\nOS: Windows 10 build 19608.1006\r\nBrowser: Edge - Anaheim - Version 85.0.545.0 (Official build) dev (64-bit)\r\nURL: https://preview.pwabuilder.com/\r\n\r\n**Pre-Requisite:**\r\nResize the browser to 200%\r\n\r\n**Repro Steps**\r\n1. Open the URL https://preview.pwabuilder.com/ in Edge Anaheim dev browser.\r\n2. Pwabuilder home page will open.\r\n3. Navigate to all the controls present on the screen.\r\n4. Observe the issue.\r\n\r\n**Actual Result**\r\n'Get Started' button, 'PWA Starter' & 'Our privacy statement' links and all other controls present after 'Start' button are not visible and accessible at 200% resize mode.\r\n\r\n**Expected Result**\r\n'Get Started' button, 'PWA Starter' & 'Our privacy statement' links and all other controls present after 'Start' button should be visible and accessible at 200% resize mode.\r\n\r\n**Note:**\r\nIssue is repro at 400% mode also.\r\nThis issue is also repro for below URL's:\r\n1.https://preview.pwabuilder.com/?url                      \r\n2.https://preview.pwabuilder.com/ ?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen-in%2F                             3.https://preview.pwabuilder.com/feature/Install%20your%20PWA.   4.https://preview.pwabuilder.com/feature/Web%20MIDI   5.https://preview.pwabuilder.com/feature/People%20Picker%20Graph%20Component  6.https://preview.pwabuilder.com/feature/Immersive%20Reader\r\n\r\n**MAS Reference:**\r\nhttps://microsoft.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/teams/msenable/_layouts/15/WopiFrame.aspx?sourcedoc=%7Bb69e5ccc-dde2-4406-b550-4deb38648f6d%7D&cid=62957902-0753-4e30-9eb4-a1efd4b9730e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[MAS1.4.4_Homepage_Controls present after start button are not visible at 200% mode.zip](https://github.com/pwa-builder/PWABuilder/files/4792636/MAS1.4.4_Homepage_Controls.present.after.start.button.are.not.visible.at.200.mode.zip)\r\n\r\n![MAS1 4 4_resize_controls present after start button not visible](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/66783558/86102357-0e5f0800-bad9-11ea-957e-57eede6e1f88.png)\r\n\r\n",
